      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "I'd say a couple of weeks, but Gran has him most days, so she'd know better.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, I couldn't say, love. He's been like it a while, months, maybe longer. I didn't write it down.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:48",
      "end_timestamp": "00:57",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's fine, I'll treat it as an on-and-off problem for a while. What are the poos like when they do come?",
